                                                "sense_id": "2cb5e25c-7da8-365d-8d7c-2b2bfdb0bfef",
                                                "text": "The same conflict between the monism of temporal theorists and the dualism of ecclesiastical thinkers—the same opposition of organic to symbiotic union—occurred in the ninth century."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d3ea4e9a-e57a-3689-b9a0-510ae2977ee6",
